# Only build inputs enter the context. In particular, no Git history, credentials or local notes.
**
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!build.rs
!.cargo/
!.cargo/config.toml
!src/
!src/**
!docs/
!docs/DIALECT.md
!packaging/
!packaging/package.sh
!packaging/third_party_licenses.py
!packaging/README.md
!examples/
!examples/data/
!examples/data/**
!LICENSE
!CHANGELOG.md
**/*.local.md
**/.env*
**/.git
